# Animations · hover · icons · badges (must)

Every interactive / card UI needs **icons + hover + cursor-pointer**. Motion should feel intentional, not noisy.

## Icons

- UI icons: `lucide-react`
- Social: project `@/components/ui/SocialIcons` when present (not Lucide Facebook/Instagram/Youtube)
- Badges / pills / CTAs: include an icon when it clarifies action

## Badges

- Prefer reusable badge primitives in `ui/*`
- Accents from brand CSS vars (see `naturavive-brand.mdc` / `@/config/brand`)
- On card hover: stronger accent + light scale/shadow when designed

## Hover (must)

- Links, buttons, cards, social, nav: visible hover state
- `cursor-pointer` on all interactive controls
- Footer links / social → brand accent hover
- Primary buttons → brand hover from shared button primitive
- Cards → subtle lift/scale + border accent when design uses that pattern

## Animations

- Prefer **Motion** (`motion/react`) for section enter, card stagger, hover lift
- Stagger ~0.1–0.15s; `viewport={{ once: true }}` for scroll enters
- GSAP only for complex timelines; do not add both for the same effect
- Swiper for carousels; `overflow-visible` if outer border animates
- Respect reduced motion; never block core UX on animation

## Never

- Bare buttons/links with no hover
- Missing `cursor-pointer` on clickable UI
- Heavy/looping animations that distract
- New icon libraries when Lucide / SocialIcons already cover it
